      "entryId": "shanhaijing-09-10",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "雨师妾在其北，其为人黑，两手各操一"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-09-11",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "人，衣鱼食，使两鸟夹之。一曰在雨师妾北。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "soushenji-01-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "赤松子者，神农时雨师也，服冰玉散，以教神农，能入火"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "soushenji-04-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "风伯、雨师，星也。风伯者，箕星也。雨师者"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "chuci-05-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "远兮,\n\n徐弭节而高厉。\n\n左雨师使径侍兮,\n\n右雷公以为卫。\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-02-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "区；可以步而步，可以骤而骤；令雨师洒道，使风伯塌尘；电以为鞭策，"
    }
